{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr3e2Bj5acRRewzam5UK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't open the repository, so this diagnosis rests on the bug report and my memory of the upstream brocoders nestjs-boilerplate. The line ranges are estimates.\n\nThe `@Transform` on the `path` column of the file entity most likely builds the local URL from `appConfig().frontendDomain` instead of `appConfig().backendDomain`. User responses include the serialized file, which is why `/auth/me` shows the wrong host."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2160,"cache_read_input_tokens":791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2160},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5e6a1f48-10e5-477a-8945-bf6690f23fdd","uuid":"9e51ccfd-d012-43bc-a288-5c12e7fe93ce","timestamp":"2026-11-08T19:53:43.390Z","request_id":"req_011Cgr3e1zaDuqwsh6kVpaxS"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr3e2Bj5acRRewzam5UK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BsnVwP81h6HXQno2dr8gtf","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"candidates":[{"file":"src/files/infrastructure/persistence/relational/entities/file.entity.ts","symbol":"FileEntity.path (@Transform)","start_line":18,"end_line":40,"explanation":"The @Transform on the `path` column handles the FileDriver.LOCAL case. It most likely prefixes the stored path with appConfig().frontendDomain instead of appConfig().backendDomain. Local files are served by the backend (FilesLocalController), so avatar URLs in user responses such as /auth/me point at the web app host and fail to load. I could not open the file, so the lines are an estimate."},{"file":"src/files/infrastructure/persistence/document/entities/file.schema.ts","symbol":"FileSchemaClass.path (@Transform)","start_line":15,"end_line":40,"explanation":"The MongoDB document schema has the same @Transform for `path`. If it also uses frontendDomain for the LOCAL driver, it produces the same wrong URL prefix. Unverified."}],"fix":{"file":"src/files/infrastructure/persistence/relational/entities/file.entity.ts","description":"In the FileDriver.LOCAL branch of the path @Transform, use (appConfig() as AppConfig).backendDomain instead of frontendDomain. Make the same change in the document schema's file.schema.ts."}},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2160,"cache_read_input_tokens":791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2160},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5e6a1f48-10e5-477a-8945-bf6690f23fdd","uuid":"5261b742-0176-4624-b132-89